    "summary": "Errata to the Venom, rewriting 2 sections.\n\n[Aerialists](vsdata:ability/drukhari.venom.aerialists): as the Fight phase ends, if this **TRANSPORT** has no models embarked within it, you may pick 1 friendly **DRUKHARI INFANTRY** unit of 6 or fewer models wholly within 6\" of it (units that can **FLY** are excluded). If that unit is outside **Engagement Range** of all enemy units, it may embark within this **TRANSPORT**, even if it left a **TRANSPORT** by disembarking earlier that turn.\n\nIts Transport section now says this model can carry 6 **DRUKHARI INFANTRY** models, but no **JUMP PACK** models. As the Declare Battle Formations step begins, before the battle, you may pick 1 **KABALITE WARRIORS**, **HAND OF THE ARCHON** or **WYCHES** unit of yours not split before and split it into 2 units with model counts as equal as possible, noting which models form each. After the split:\n\n- 1 new unit must begin the battle inside this model\n- the other may begin inside another **TRANSPORT** or be deployed on its own",
